    "detailed_description": "Enter the thrilling world of pawnbroking and treasure hunting in &quot;Pawn Shop Simulator&quot;. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1904360/extras/7ce5afa539c77bbdae8cb92dda4a0314.avif?t=1748804461\" /></div><br>Renovate your shop by cleaning the floor, painting the walls and designing where products are displayed.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1904360/extras/86f2a2fe61df634b5d8d61a24e006b1a.poster.avif?t=1748804461\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1904360/extras/86f2a2fe61df634b5d8d61a24e006b1a.webm?t=1748804461\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1904360/extras/86f2a2fe61df634b5d8d61a24e006b1a.mp4?t=1748804461\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1904360/extras/577181a00c8740380a9615b99b8c1ecc.avif?t=1748804461\" /></div><br>Participate in storage auctions. Find trash or treasures like jewlery, guitars, then sell them in your pawn shop.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1904360/extras/a80e68098090d59bcae8838ea084d322.poster.avif?t=1748804461\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1904360/extras/a80e68098090d59bcae8838ea084d322.webm?t=1748804461\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1904360/extras/a80e68098090d59bcae8838ea084d322.mp4?t=1748804461\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1904360/extras/9dc0a4e0e8ffaead1f4907c4a796a1cb.avif?t=1748804461\" /></div><br>Organize your items on shelves and set their prices. Products without a market value can be evaluated at an appraiser/evaluator.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1904360/extras/cd4a2157f43cd332ffffdc8056987b16.poster.avif?t=1748804461\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1904360/extras/cd4a2157f43cd332ffffdc8056987b16.webm?t=1748804461\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1904360/extras/cd4a2157f43cd332ffffdc8056987b16.mp4?t=1748804461\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1904360/extras/417fff29c77d92819fe91e16e5caab5c.avif?t=1748804461\" /></div><br>Move to checkout and become a cashier, process the items and payment, exactly like in a supermarket. <br>You can sell or buy items from clients.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1904360/extras/81a28d89bd8b72d9695771ac46fbfdce.poster.avif?t=1748804461\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1904360/extras/81a28d89bd8b72d9695771ac46fbfdce.webm?t=1748804461\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1904360/extras/81a28d89bd8b72d9695771ac46fbfdce.mp4?t=1748804461\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Start now your shop, go to storage auctions or buy directly from clients, all in &quot;Pawn Shop Simulator&quot;.",
    "about_the_game": "Enter the thrilling world of pawnbroking and treasure hunting in &quot;Pawn Shop Simulator&quot;. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1904360/extras/7ce5afa539c77bbdae8cb92dda4a0314.avif?t=1748804461\" /></div><br>Renovate your shop by cleaning the floor, painting the walls and designing where products are displayed.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1904360/extras/86f2a2fe61df634b5d8d61a24e006b1a.poster.avif?t=1748804461\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1904360/extras/86f2a2fe61df634b5d8d61a24e006b1a.webm?t=1748804461\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1904360/extras/86f2a2fe61df634b5d8d61a24e006b1a.mp4?t=1748804461\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1904360/extras/577181a00c8740380a9615b99b8c1ecc.avif?t=1748804461\" /></div><br>Participate in storage auctions. Find trash or treasures like jewlery, guitars, then sell them in your pawn shop.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1904360/extras/a80e68098090d59bcae8838ea084d322.poster.avif?t=1748804461\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1904360/extras/a80e68098090d59bcae8838ea084d322.webm?t=1748804461\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1904360/extras/a80e68098090d59bcae8838ea084d322.mp4?t=1748804461\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1904360/extras/9dc0a4e0e8ffaead1f4907c4a796a1cb.avif?t=1748804461\" /></div><br>Organize your items on shelves and set their prices. Products without a market value can be evaluated at an appraiser/evaluator.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1904360/extras/cd4a2157f43cd332ffffdc8056987b16.poster.avif?t=1748804461\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1904360/extras/cd4a2157f43cd332ffffdc8056987b16.webm?t=1748804461\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1904360/extras/cd4a2157f43cd332ffffdc8056987b16.mp4?t=1748804461\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1904360/extras/417fff29c77d92819fe91e16e5caab5c.avif?t=1748804461\" /></div><br>Move to checkout and become a cashier, process the items and payment, exactly like in a supermarket. <br>You can sell or buy items from clients.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1904360/extras/81a28d89bd8b72d9695771ac46fbfdce.poster.avif?t=1748804461\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1904360/extras/81a28d89bd8b72d9695771ac46fbfdce.webm?t=1748804461\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1904360/extras/81a28d89bd8b72d9695771ac46fbfdce.mp4?t=1748804461\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Start now your shop, go to storage auctions or buy directly from clients, all in &quot;Pawn Shop Simulator&quot;.",
